e Me requests, and irrelevant links aren't allowed.  If you would like to be a partner of Fastpitch Talk, please email adam@fastpitchtalk.com about what you offer and we can discuss becoming a partner.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"4062181410678869\",\n          \"title\": \"No posting links to outside websites or groups\",\n          \"description\": \"Please keep the conversation focused on our community, and do not try to drive people to other groups or websites.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"4062182014012142\",\n          \"title\": \"No Selling Used Equipment\",\n          \"description\": \"There are lots of groups for that.  Go post your used equipment there.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"4096567703906906\",\n          \"title\": \"Posts Must Be Relevant To Fastpitch Softball\",\n          \"description\": \"Please make sure all posts are relevant to Fastpitch Softball, or the will be removed.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"4091668201063523\",\n          \"title\": \"Content Must Be Visible\",\n          \"description\": \"Any post with content not easily visible or with broken links will be removed.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"4097330700497273\",\n          \"title\": \"No Duplicate Content\",\n          \"description\": \"Please don't post things that have recently been posted in the last 30 days unless you are an approved partner.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"4062180564012287\",\n          \"title\": \"Be kind and courteous\",\n          \"description\": \"We're all in this together to create a Welcoming environment. Let's treat everyone with respect. Healthy debates are natural, but kindness is required.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"4062180610678949\",\n          \"title\": \"No hate speech or bullying\",\n          \"description\": \"Make sure everyone feels safe. Bullying of any kind isn't allowed, and degrading comments about things like race, religion, culture, sexual orientation, gender or identity will not be tolerated.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"requestId\": \"req_4d028d15-e2a4-4f3f-bc34-ba1a48f51c93\",\n    \"creditsCharged\": 1,\n    \"version\": \"v1\"\n  }\n}"},{"type":"text","text":"{\"conversation_id\":\"01a1b1a8-7697-7c25-b970-33fd88a5814f\"}"}],"structuredContent":{"data":{"lookupStatus":"found","group":{"platform":"facebook","id":"1735069526723414","url":"https://www.facebook.com/groups/1735069526723414","name":"Fastpitch Talk","description":null,"createdAt":"2016-01-13T21:19:54.000Z","historySummary":"Group created on January 13, 2016. Name last changed on February 3, 2020.","privacy":{"label":"Public","description":"Anyone can see who's in the group and what they post."},"visibility":{"label":"Visible","description":"Anyone can find this group."},"categories":[{"id":"302991944456008","name":"Team Sports"}],"memberCount":120217,"administratorCount":3,"moderatorCount":0,"administrators":[{"id":"pfbid02wPrTKSkRnHWu78UGPQiEvBQhB5SMsdj5DavxVQwRQEGMt958cHZM3VoxXLMYyYjel","name":"Adley Roseland","url":null,"profilePictureUrl":"https://scontent-ord5-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-1/891773128_122182586282707233_3969434984090544980_n.avif?stp=cp0_dst-avif&cstp=mx206x206&ctp=s32x32&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=e99d92&_nc_ohc=2F_ZslxxxeYQ7kNvwFEcDt4&_nc_oc=AdqNdaUIytTzcCe5jqjkR5mxvllYoX02e6vZbNwAwUW567RY292c-CSyH0_AyHO_LE0&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.xx&_nc_gid=KM0En0QvvHnfpg80bjLuPA&_nc_ss=78180&oh=00_AQRnG8FZEeW8RiP0njkVPhp7B04UDVXNk3aOEailVRYWEg&oe=6AF3E16B"},{"id":"61570020415457","name":"Fastpitch Talk","url":"https://www.facebook.com/fastpitch.talk.2024","profilePictureUrl":"https://scontent-ord5-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-1/480270007_122115738392667347_5735544246871543419_n.jpg?stp=c637.0.747.748a_cp0_dst-jpg_tt6&cstp=mx747x748&ctp=s32x32&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=111fe6&_nc_ohc=ZtgycvAzPHcQ7kNvwEaUzNz&_nc_oc=Ado5_N1XASr6QykIkbTEOqBt7AmAYfzNW06_qG7_Wn3dxC28Wq